# Where code goes

- `crates/victory-game` = title (offsets, signatures, containers).
- Every other crate = platform. Keep title-specific bytes out of platform crates.

# Changing behavior

- Leave the default path alone. New speedups are flags that default to the old path until there is a captured frame and a clean D3D12 Debug Layer run.
- Do not replace the incremental `heap_buffers` walk (`VICTORY_HEAP_RESCAN_FRAMES`, rotating 1/N slice) with a full scan.
